<title>USA: Ethyl Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Ethyl Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			 28,500		   17,000</p>
<p> Sales		    304,200		  241,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 118,444		  118,442</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
